  "title": "Zavelyn Rain Drum™ (3-Inch 6-Tone Outdoor Pocket Drum)",
  "body_html": "\n    <h2>The Enchanting 3-Inch Outdoor Garden Rain Drum &amp; Pocket Melodic Companion</h2>\n    <p>The <strong>Zavelyn Rain Drum™</strong> is our ultra-portable 3-inch (8 cm) 6-tone steel tongue drum designed for both acoustic outdoor garden ambiance and on-the-go mindful relaxation. Place it on your patio, balcony, or garden rockery to let raindrops play natural chime symphonies, or tap serene melodies anywhere using the included solid wooden mallet.</p>\n    \n    <h3>Why You Will Adore the Zavelyn Rain Drum™:</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>\n<strong>Natural Raindrop Resonator:</strong> Specially tuned harmonic tongues ring out crystal-clear chimes whenever outdoor raindrops patter across its surface.</li>\n      <li>\n<strong>Pocket-Sized Portability:</strong> At just 3 inches (8 cm) and 115 grams, it slips effortlessly into your pocket, backpack, or desk drawer for instant stress relief.</li>\n      <li>\n<strong>6 Harmonic Chime Notes:</strong> Precision laser-cut Pentatonic scale guarantees every tap produces sweet, chime-like, meditative tones with zero discordance.</li>\n      <li>\n<strong>All-Weather Rustproof Enamel:</strong> Electrostatic baked powder-coated finish repels rain, humidity, sun, and frost for years of outdoor enjoyment.</li>\n      <li>\n<strong>No Musical Skill Needed:</strong> Numbered tone petals make intuitive play effortless for toddlers, adults, and grandparents alike.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h3>What's Included in Your Rain Drum Kit:</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>1x Zavelyn Rain Drum™ (3-Inch / 8 cm, 6-Tone Pentatonic Tuning)</li>\n      <li>1x Solid Wooden Mallet with Rubber Resonance Tip</li>\n      <li>1x Set of Pre-Applied Numbered Tone Decals</li>\n      <li>1x Pocket Protective Velvet Pouch</li>\n    </ul>\n  ",
